---
// WORKS の分類別一覧ページ（ヘッダーのプルダウン・トップの分類ボタンからの移動先）
import Layout from "../../../layouts/Layout.astro";
import Contact from "../../../components/Contact.astro";
import ProjectNav from "../../../components/ProjectNav.astro";
import CategoryTabs from "../../../components/CategoryTabs.astro";
import { categories, casesIn } from "../../../data/categories.js";
import { langParams, getLang, useT, localePath } from "../../../i18n.js";

export function getStaticPaths() {
  return langParams.flatMap(({ lang }) => categories.map((c) => ({ params: { lang, category: c.id }, props: { category: c } })));
}

const lang = getLang(Astro.params.lang);
const t = useT(lang);
const { category } = Astro.props;
const name = t(category.ja, category.en);
const cases = casesIn(category.id, lang);
---

<Layout lang={lang} title={`${name} — Works — Kai Usui Portfolio`} description={t(`${name}での制作実績の一覧です。`, `Works for ${name}.`)}>
  <div style="min-height:100vh;position:relative;background:#eef4fb;">
    <ProjectNav lang={lang} />

    <section class="section" style="padding-top:80px;position:relative;">
      <div
        class="ghost"
        style="position:absolute;top:20px;left:50%;transform:translateX(-50%);font-size:clamp(60px,10vw,150px);z-index:0;opacity:.7;white-space:nowrap;"
      >
        WORKS
      </div>
      <div class="wrap" style="position:relative;z-index:1;">
        <div style="text-align:center;">
          <div class="eyebrow" style="justify-content:center;">My Works</div>
          <h1 class="disp" style="font-size:clamp(30px,4.2vw,48px);font-weight:800;color:var(--ink);">{name}</h1>
          <p style="font-size:13.5px;color:var(--ink-faint);margin-top:10px;">{t(`${cases.length}件の制作実績`, `${cases.length} projects`)}</p>
          <a href={localePath(lang, "/") + "#works"} style="font-size:13.5px;color:var(--accent-2);display:inline-block;margin-top:10px;">← Back to home</a>
        </div>

        <CategoryTabs lang={lang} current={category.id} center />

        <div class="projects-grid" style="margin-top:44px;">
          {
            cases.map((c) => (
              <a href={localePath(lang, c.path)} class="project-card" style="padding:14px;display:block;">
                <img src={c.src} style="width:100%;display:block;aspect-ratio:4/5;object-fit:cover;border-radius:16px;" alt={c.label} />
                <div style="padding:14px 4px 0 4px;font-family:'Sora',sans-serif;font-size:11.5px;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:.08em;color:var(--accent-2);">CASE {c.caseNumber}</div>
                <div style="padding:4px 4px 4px 4px;font-size:12.5px;font-weight:600;color:var(--ink-soft);">{c.label}</div>
              </a>
            ))
          }
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <Contact lang={lang} />
  </div>
</Layout>
